], "id": "2115601276365049982", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1982, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115596081430237618", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "حادثه در سایت هسته‌ای Savannah River (SRS) در کارولینای جنوبی گزارش شده.\nآتش‌سوزی در یک اتاق آزمایشگاه ملی Savannah River National Laboratory منجر به اعلام «Site Area Emergency» شده. آتش خاموش شده و طبق بیانیه رسمی، هیچ آلودگی خارج از تأسیسات گزارش نشده.\nسازمان هواپیمایی آمریکا https://t.co/1iuRgGva7M", "url": "https://x.com/J74wabx/status/2115601276365049982"}, {"author_id": "4482143834", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:32:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115572396346454020"], "id": "2115572396346454020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 58, "impression_count": 11727, "like_count": 221, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "Throughout history, heat &amp; saunas were associated with the womb. The ancient Maya built sweat baths symbolizing the body of a goddess. In Lakota tradition, entering the sweat lodge represents returning to the womb of Mother Earth. Fertility is warmth and warmth is fertility. https://t.co/K1QB1egUFu", "url": "https://x.com/BioavailableNd/status/2115572396346454020"}, {"author_id": "1028413513885208578", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:10:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115597131209965912"], "id": "2115597131209965912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2074, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "PD-L1 on B cell zone reticular cells, including follicular dendritic cells, promotes humoral immunity by restraining a subset of Tfh that promotes Tfr development @ImmunityCP @eakamagarren @BostonChildrens \nhttps://t.co/KqCuNPtnom https://t.co/2KVMxTJZIz", "url": "https://x.com/LabWaggoner/status/2115597131209965912"}, {"author_id": "1490006696105693185", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:00:3